			]
			description: [
				"Once you have gathered enough of those, you will then need to get a little bit harder materials to craft the proper ingots:"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"4 &dIridium ingots&f 1 piece of Dark Matter and 4 pieces of the following items:"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"4 &4Cthonic Crystals&f found in the Nether to craft Hellspec Ingots."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"4 &eCircuit Boards&f crafted using vanilla and Terramity Items to get a Conductite Ingot."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
