		{
			dependencies: ["770BF6E8DA6010C0"]
			description: [
				"Once you have acquired a Tier 2 Pickaxe you can mine Profanum Ore."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"&6Profanum &fis used as a base for every Tier 3 Bar as well as various other items and blocks such as the Moondrill Cannon."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
