		{
			dependencies: ["14DDBB7CA3A71F56"]
			description: [
				"Good job at coming all the way here!"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"You have just reached the peak of Terramity but things will now get the hardest possible so make sure to prepare physically (&9and mentally&f)."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"To start with (&9and luckily for you&f) none of these armor sets require any upgrade trims."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Instead you will need Antiprism an item droped by Gundalf this mod's final (&9and maybe most difficult&f) boss."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Don't worry, you don't have to fight Gundalf a million times due to Antiprisms being duplicatable with Prismatic Jewels."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Now, the ingots required to craft these three armor sets can be found by the following methods:"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"For &9Nyxium&f you'll need Opaline Moonstone."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"This item can only be found by striking the moon during a full moon using a Moondrill Cannon."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"For &eReverirum&f you will need Angel Feathers droped by Virtue an optional boss."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"For &5Exodium&f you will need Cracked Ectoprism."
				"You can create this item by dropping Empty Essence into a blackhole."
			]
			id: "3699BCBBF3B6FD50"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "5E8D7F17A7E96E79"
					type: "xp"
